I wrote a very simple patch for that some game versions ago (yes, the
version currently on my web page is for 3.4.3). I decided to just put the
number in curly braces at the end of the log entry, so that it looks like
this: 
3.4.3 5117704 7 -5 49 193 281 0 20040924 20040907 500 Val Dwa Fem Law
jukka,ascended {74719}

where 74719 is the move counter. If you prefer some other format,
modifying the patch should be trivial. The patch can be downloaded from 
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html#moves

but I have no idea whether it might cause some problem with some software
possibly used to handle the tournament results, or whether the tournament
organizers dislike the idea for some other reason.

